{"detail":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src https://daesan.ai https://*.daesan.ai https://cafe24img.com https://*.cafe24img.com https://www.kccworld.co.kr/assets/images/ho/bm/img_hb_mark.jpg; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\"><meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"><style>@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:400;src:url(fonts/400) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:500;src:url(fonts/500) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:600;src:url(fonts/600) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:700;src:url(fonts/700) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:800;src:url(fonts/800) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}html,body{margin:0;padding:0}body{display:flow-root;font:12px/1.5 Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#353535}p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,ul,ol,li,dl,dt,dd,figure{margin:0;padding:0}table{width:100%;border:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse}img{border:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:100%}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}#cafe24-detail{max-width:790px;margin:auto}@media(min-width:701px){#cafe24-detail h3.ds-block-title{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 20px}}@media(max-width:700px){body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:#1b1b1b}td,th{line-height:18px}#cafe24-detail{width:95.25%}}</style><style>\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap{max-width:790px;margin:0 auto;font-family:'Pretendard','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;line-height:1.75;color:#1C1C1C;background:#FAF9F6;font-size:15px;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap,#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap *{box-sizing:border-box;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap img{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap figure{margin:0;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-hero{width:100%;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-intro{padding:26px 0 8px;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-kicker{font-size:13px;color:#123628;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 6px;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap h2{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.4;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-define{color:#616161;margin:0;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-block-title{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#1C1C1C;margin:32px 0 14px;padding-left:10px;border-left:4px solid #123628;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-caption{font-size:13px;color:#616161;margin:10px 0 0;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-drawing{padding:20px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-drawing img{width:395px;margin:0 auto;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;margin:0;border-top:1px solid #E0E0E0;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table th{background:#F8F8F8;color:#616161;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;padding:13px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E0E0E0;width:30%;text-align:left;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table td{background:#FFFFFF;color:#1C1C1C;font-size:15px;padding:13px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E0E0E0;text-align:left;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-reason{background:#F8F8F8;border:1px solid #E0E0E0;border-top:2px solid #123628;border-radius:6px;padding:18px;margin:0;color:#616161;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-reason ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-reason li+li{margin-top:8px;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-faq{margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-faq-item{background:#F8F8F8;border:1px solid #E0E0E0;border-radius:6px;padding:15px 16px;margin:0 0 12px;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-faq-q{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#123628;margin:0 0 6px;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-faq-a{font-size:14px;color:#616161;margin:0;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-cta{display:block;width:100%;background:#123628;color:#FFFFFF;padding:16px;border-radius:6px;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 12px;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-cta:hover{opacity:0.92;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-phone{color:#616161;font-size:13px;text-align:center;margin:0 0 20px;}\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-footer{background:#123628;color:#FFFFFF;text-align:center;padding:20px;font-size:13px;}\r\n@media(max-width:768px){#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap{padding:0 16px;font-size:13px;}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap h2{font-size:20px;}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-block-title{font-size:16px;}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table th,#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table td{display:block;width:100%;font-size:13px;}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table th{border-bottom:0;padding-bottom:4px;}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table td{padding-top:4px;}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-cta{font-size:14px;}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-faq-q{font-size:14px;}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-faq-a{font-size:13px;}}\r\n\r\n#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-content{padding:0 30px 30px}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-intro{padding:34px 30px 24px}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-size{color:#123628;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin:4px 0 0}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-ai-note{padding:10px 30px 0;margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#616161}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-hero{width:100%;max-height:790px;object-fit:contain;background:#FFFFFF}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-example{width:100%}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-summary{margin:0;color:#616161}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-checks{margin-bottom:28px}@media(max-width:768px){#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap{padding:0}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-content{padding:0 20px 24px}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-intro{padding:26px 20px 20px}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-ai-note{padding:10px 20px 0}#ds-silver-tape.ds-wrap .ds-size{font-size:18px}}\r\n</style></head><body><div id=\"cafe24-detail\">\r\n\r\n<div id=\"ds-silver-tape\" class=\"ds-wrap\">\r\n <div class=\"ds-intro\"><p class=\"ds-kicker\">단열재 시공 부자재</p><h2>열반사 단열재 은박테이프</h2><p class=\"ds-size\">50mm × 50m</p></div>\r\n <figure><img alt=\"안쪽 라벨과 제조사 로고가 없는 은색 테이프 롤의 사용자 승인 이미지\" class=\"ds-hero\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/prod_detail/silver-tape-50x50/daesan-silver-tape-50x50-approved.png\" /></figure>\r\n <p class=\"ds-ai-note\">AI 연출 이미지로, 실제 제품의 외관·색상과 다를 수 있습니다.</p>\r\n <div class=\"ds-content\">\r\n <h3 class=\"ds-block-title\">한눈에 보기</h3><p class=\"ds-summary\">열반사 단열재의 이음부를 연결하고 마감할 때 사용하는 은박테이프입니다.<br />폭 50mm, 길이 50m 규격으로 단열재 연결 부위의 마감 작업에 사용합니다.</p>\r\n <h3 class=\"ds-block-title\">시공 예시</h3><figure><img alt=\"맞닿은 두 장의 열반사 단열재 이음부 위에 은색 테이프를 붙이고 도구로 눌러 밀착시키는 AI 시공 예시\" class=\"ds-example\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/prod_detail/silver-tape-50x50/daesan-silver-tape-50x50-installation.png\" /><figcaption class=\"ds-caption\">연출 예시입니다. 실제 시공은 사용하는 단열재와 테이프의 시공 지침을 확인해 주세요.</figcaption></figure>\r\n <h3 class=\"ds-block-title\">규격 정보</h3><table class=\"ds-spec-table\"><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">상품명</th><td>열반사 단열재 은박테이프</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">폭</th><td>50mm</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">길이</th><td>50m</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">주요 용도</th><td>열반사 단열재 이음부 연결 및 마감</td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n <h3 class=\"ds-block-title\">구매 전 체크포인트</h3><div class=\"ds-reason ds-checks\"><ul><li>부착면의 먼지와 이물질을 제거해 주세요.</li><li>부착면을 건조한 상태로 준비해 주세요.</li><li>테이프를 부착한 뒤 충분히 눌러 밀착시켜 주세요.</li><li>실제 접착 상태는 시공 표면과 환경에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</li></ul></div>\r\n <h3 class=\"ds-block-title\">자주 묻는 질문</h3><div class=\"ds-faq\"><div class=\"ds-faq-item\"><h4 class=\"ds-faq-q\">부착 전 무엇을 준비해야 하나요?</h4><p class=\"ds-faq-a\">부착면의 먼지와 이물질을 제거하고 건조한 상태로 준비해 주세요. 부착 후에는 충분히 눌러 밀착시켜 주세요.</p></div></div>\r\n  <a class=\"ds-cta\" href=\"https://web-cadalog-ver10.vercel.app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">대량구매 견적 · 규격 확인하기 →</a>\r\n  <div class=\"ds-phone\">전화 031-388-3833 · 평일 09:00–18:00</div>\r\n  <div class=\"ds-footer\">(주)대산 · 35년 신뢰의 건축자재 전문 공급사</div>\r\n </div>\r\n</div></div></body></html>","additional":[],"unconfirmed":false}